WEBVTT

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:04.460
We'll be right back.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.520
I think we should do this every day.

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.770
The sun will do you good.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.130
Except to do now.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.220
Zidho, what are you doing here?

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:28.850
Keep following me!

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:32.990
I want my notebook.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.050
Damn, guess I shouldn't be surprised.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.990
Too bad, things got a little complicated recently.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.560
I have no idea where it is.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.490
Why am I not surprised?

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.980
Look, I told you, stop following me.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.470
Then give me back my notebook.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.370
I don't know where it is.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.340
If you want it back, you're going to have to look for it yourself.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:10.600
Whammy's house isn't exactly a normal orphanage. It's like a school for gifted children, but here's the crazy part.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:15.220
Its real purpose is to groom these kids so that one of them could become the next L.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.980
L's successor?

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:22.000
Apparently, the one most likely to succeed L is this kid named Nir.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.120
Nir? Is that N?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.970
Also, we found some leads on Melo, the one N mentioned. He's smart too, but he always came s-

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.770
second to Nier. So Nier was meant to be El's successor. There's no mistake. He has to be

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:41.700
N. He's the one commanding the SPK. As for Melo, he would have wanted to become El's successor,

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:46.900
but he probably lost out to Nier. That gives him a motive for wanting to get his hands on the

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:54.070
notebook first. It all adds up perfectly. This guy is definitely the same Melo that N told us

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:58.720
about. These are sketches of both of them. We couldn't find any photographs.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:06.580
It looks like I'm still fighting L after all this time.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:14.300
First things first, I have to find out where Mello and his Mafia associates are hiding themselves.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:19.240
I already had Misa check a list of known Mafia syndicates using her Shinigami eyes.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.880
They have enlisted as Jack Nalon, but his real name is Cal Snyder. He's got the notebook.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:36.980
After that, it was a simple matter of using the Death Note to make Snyder send a letter to me with the location of the gang's hideout.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.620
It should be arriving soon.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.100
He's in L.A. I did it.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.620
I outmaneuvered both Near and Mellow.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.080
Guess it's no surprise.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:56.360
As long as I have the notebook in Misa's eyes, I'm unstoppable.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:04.440
So light, I guess this means I was helpful to you again, doesn't it?

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.970
Yeah, I love you, Misa.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:37.150
The next step is for me to figure out just how much I can control people with this thing.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:42.140
Oh, they're gonna have to be able to see me before I can even talk to them.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.400
What a drag.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.720
Looks like Snyder's the owner right now.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.770
Guess I'll have to make him touch the notebook first.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:52.870
Oh, well.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.240
Tag, you're it.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.660
The, uh...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.280
The notebook just flew.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.780
Ha, it's a notebook that kills people.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.860
Hell, nothing surprises me anymore.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.160
Boss, who is this?

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:11.720
The guy in the freaky costume.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:12.700
Who the hell is he?

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:14.160
Who brought him here?

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.480
I came here on my own.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.160
I'm actually a shinigami.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.760
A shinigami?

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:23.180
If you don't want everyone to think you're crazy,

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.330
pass the notebook around so they can see me too.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.970
He says you can see him if...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:39.960
touch the notebook please everyone touch it i swear i'm not crazy and whatever come on guys

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:54.380
touch the notebook was it there the last time i touched it should i kill it nice try you humans

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:59.650
can't kill a shinigami jack's right that ain't no costume

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.090
That's a real, live Shinigami.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:03.390
So now what do we do?

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:09.500
Ryuk, as of now, I'm going to forfeit ownership of this notebook.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:14.100
All I ask is that you agree to follow whichever person I give it to.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.700
What? You're giving up ownership again?

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.840
But wait, won't you lose all your memories if you do that?

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:24.890
Misa, lend me your notebook. Keep it on me like this.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:28.830
That way, even if I forfeit ownership of my notebook, I won't lose my memory.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:29.970
I'll give you as...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:36.360
many pages as you need from this moment on you're going to be kid can you do that of course but i

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:43.430
don't get why you're doing this i'll explain everything to you right now i won't forgive any

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:54.580
mistakes chocolate is so good hey what about that stuff you told us is it true if the person

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:59.180
using the note fails to consecutively write names of people to be killed within 13 days of each other

00:07:59.180 --> 00:07:59.920
then the user

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.500
will die.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.940
If you make this note unusable by tearing it up or burning it,

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.500
all the humans who have touched the note till then will die.

