Oh yeah, those rules are definitely fake.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:17.960
My guess is some Shinigami wrote those down as a joke before giving the notebook to a human.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.730
As for the 13 day rule,

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.240
We can test that out by using one of our people.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.320
But the real question is...

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:28.040
Was this the notebook that was used by Kira?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:29.400
And if so,

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:32.170
Was he aware that these two rules were false?

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:36.160
If he did know, he could have used these rules to his advantage.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:42.280
In particular, the 13-day rule would have allowed him to prove his innocence in only 13 days.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.560
Sido, go keep watch outside.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.620
It'll be very convenient for us that you can't be seen by humans.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.220
Go outside and keep watch. Got it?

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:59.290
What's with this guy? He's human, but he's scary.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:07.940
Geogamy speaking.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:09.880
This is killer.

