00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:58.980
I've gathered information from the FBI and other sources on November 10th.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:09:59.730
For example

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:06.360
11 59 p.m. Arrangements have been made so that all known associates of the Mafia will die

