00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.060
I will hand over that information along with the notebook.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:19.970
So remember.

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.410
November 10th, 11.59 p.m.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:24.920
That's when it all happens.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.380
That moment is your best and only chance to get the notebook back.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:29.870
It's up to you.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:48.650
