00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:52.260
If the Mafia members are going to die on the day Kit has specified,

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:54.280
It would be a chance to get the notebook back.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:57.940
I don't like the idea of following Kit as planned, but it's our best option.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:58.540
Exactly.

00:10:58.730 --> 00:10:59.010
Please.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:10.020
But still, knowing the time of death for these guys isn't going to be enough for us to make our move.

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.480
