00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.480
And then, after 13 days,

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.120
I'll die as well.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.790
Dad writes a name in the notebook.

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.040
then

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.280
When the.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.160
Time comes.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.280
Report. Is everybody ready to move in?

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:03.930
Roger.

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:11.320
All right. Deputy Director, make the ideal with the Shinigami.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:16.510
